{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "8059fb02806821792aa40274dc501aa06beb4b2c92e1310decbf42b41af58dda", "ja": "ドドンとレッスン開始！", "zh": "轰轰烈烈展开训练！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ca5299427e3d011ed26ad67945662d541a383fafbca5e6f9889916865c08f9ec", "ja": "レッスンは快調。そんな中、5人は公演で\n出す屋台メニューについて意見を出し合う。\n辛いものにハマっているのり子の意見を\n参考に、スパイシーなもの中心と決まるが、\n海美は『女子力やきそば』を作ると言う。", "zh": "训练进行得很顺利。针对公演上的摊贩菜色，\n五人纷纷提出各自的想法。\n众人采纳爱上吃辣的法子所提出的意见，\n决定以香辣口味的食物为中心，\n此时海美表示想制作『女子力炒面』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e528eccb217241ab0f7d0609c915a1b78f43d6ed9fa48098ee9eec76dc9d200d", "ja": "（今日は全体レッスンだ。みんな楽しみながら\n練習しているようで、見ていて清々しいな）", "zh": "（今天是全员训练的日子。\n大家似乎练习得很开心，我在一旁看着也很畅快。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "1d3a73ddca5fb64c57c90d315f4c03a662d9c8137f75e72cad5764100c84d739", "ja": "ワン・ツー・スリー・フォー！\nここで、花火のポーズ！", "zh": "1、2、3、4！\n在这里，摆出烟火的姿势！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2c70584c57d77d0af9638b0ab645e737b9306ea8fd2d2aba99ff9cabe23b865e", "ja": "おっ、その振り付け、いいじゃないか！　\nみんなで考えたのか？", "zh": "哦，这套舞步很棒耶！\n是你们一起想出来的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "6f8ec4c36df8272d7c6becef28b24c887e08ebd5fd5188c4615448ccb3898c8a", "ja": "そうなんだ！　こないだの花火の、\nインスパイアっていうの？　けっこういいでしょ！", "zh": "对啊！算是之前看烟火获得的灵感吧。\n挺不错的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "51318567020799b8d2f42451adaa53e3fd1a816c4cee357e25bb5ff8a9682239", "ja": "タイミングが難しいんだけど、今のは良かったよね。\nもうちょっと練習したら、バッチリかな！", "zh": "虽然时间点不好抓，但刚才跳得很好呢。\n再多练习几次，应该就会很完美了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "31ababc9214b34aeb7a1c58f2fa42222508099083be4f9244a688f3530c150f6", "ja": "{$P$}は、どう思いますか？\n意見があれば、お願いします！", "zh": "{$P$}，你觉得怎么样？\n有什么建议的话，请你告诉我们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5dfe0e3e181357faaf5815bbe5fc63f8683c6b3fa1ef2dbaa5bc144b63afc851", "ja": "うん。うまく考えて、振り付けに組み込んでる。\nいい感じだと思うよ。", "zh": "嗯，你们的点子很精采，也有融入舞步中。\n我觉得很不错喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "fd1801798ac99c1785c498fc8c936bd29affb9e5f9bba2f3f52de12b1f5a711a", "ja": "みんなと話してると、なんや楽しくってな～。\nどんどんアイディアが湧いてくるんです！", "zh": "因为跟大家讨论起来很开心呀～\n灵感就源源不绝啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "d8fedcb058294c473d31d4633e7be62458c2547d2ce69893bfcf27ff341fb6c8", "ja": "そうだね。\nついつい、時間を忘れちゃってるかも。", "zh": "是啊，\n常常会不小心就忘了时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d2c9d64346cb635e96709771e0987bb364f053ad4e2213b8e48d3fe00045c25b", "ja": "そうか。それはいい事だけど、練習のやり過ぎも\nよくないな。今日はそろそろ終わりにしよう。", "zh": "这样啊。热衷练习是好事，但太过头也不好。\n今天就先到此为止吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "c443e29d5654b20c5b221211d7eb642af59f9b86ad67e026766f3999411b3e85", "ja": "えーっ！？\n私、まだまだ全然元気なのにっ！", "zh": "咦～！？\n我还很有活力的说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "dc3e374123400f579b0617afb63a5235fdbe8053524fe33877a759d22f860d23", "ja": "気持ちは元気でも、体は疲れてるかもしれないだろ？\nもう時間も時間だし、今日はここまでにしよう。", "zh": "就算你精神上还很有活力，但身体可能已经累了啊。\n时间也不早了，今天就练到这里吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "fdeb33edd18a28620b1e7e5a5f1d730ba7252f24c8f65e829dba609cd152aece", "ja": "うー、そっかぁ。\n{$P$}がそう言うなら……。", "zh": "呜～这样喔。\n既然{$P$}都这么说了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "46446f3e5716f8b4df44a901488af314e5c02efe1bd9a82f2b6274b5e17188cf", "ja": "まあまあ海美、今日のところはおしまいにしようよ！\nそれに、屋台のこととかも考えなきゃだしね～。", "zh": "好啦～海美，今天就先告一段落吧！\n而且我们还有摊贩的东西要规划啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "ec38730b13e6672337b48ef23c944cd280616fa7effc4a7eb3b0abf577ea3715", "ja": "それもそうだね……みんな、屋台のアイディアって\n何かある？　奈緒ちゃんは？", "zh": "说得也是……大家有什么摊贩的点子吗？\n小绪有想法吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "6d14dd5508879abdc5f0555658b35eb80ca712d0a5a3070aa6c81318d7199dad", "ja": "なんで私からなん！？\nまぁでも、屋台といえばアレか、それかアレやな！", "zh": "为啥先问我呀！？\n不过嘛，说到摊贩不是这个就是那个吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "ce75a30437f19a52b69f55d41c595677d89b5c443e8a29958f7ef8bceadef0f9", "ja": "はいっ！　やきそば！！！！", "zh": "选我！炒面！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "0874a0f4cea9aa5673df67fad116ca9e198f15a797ad8d9b34d84ea6317260a7", "ja": "ええっ！？　ちゃうやん、たこ焼きやん！\nそれかお好み焼きやん！", "zh": "咦咦！？不对啦，是章鱼烧啦！\n或者是大阪烧啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "f2ff1f68b3b86941ac60e881a526526dc52da82d6bf188a307b4c94d4bce0dbb", "ja": "あ、でも、やきそばでもええな？\nうん、夏らしいというか、海の家っぽいというか♪", "zh": "啊，不过炒面好像也可以吼？\n嗯，该说很有夏天气息吗？或是有点像海边小店吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1019_019min", "source_sha256": "e7e46ced8cffe7fa6180efb01b52bdc5d2dc96de5f3ab9e957ab395c800995ce", "ja": "それなら、屋台を海の家風にするといいかも？\nだとすると、カレーなんかも欲しくなりますね～♪", "zh": "既然如此，把摊贩布置得像海边小店好像也不错？\n如果是这样的话，我还想加个咖哩进去耶～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "e0fe45ba880b74f2f6bf2ce7e049bdab0d0d6b2035e6671ad547890fe6b47f60", "ja": "海の家かぁ……うん、いいかも♪\nあ～、辛～いカレー食べたいっ！", "zh": "海边小店啊……嗯，可能不错喔♪\n啊～好想吃超～辣的咖哩喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1021_p", "source_sha256": "1898768ec416691f2670f42164a449bbd37edf42ac303f90678c34fd945ff7a7", "ja": "へえ、のり子はカレーは辛めが好きなのか。", "zh": "哦，原来法子喜欢吃偏辣的咖哩啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "83753472138ea348e9aa9b48438b65e4c61ac400bef103dcd24d7ca48e5092b9", "ja": "うん！　なんか最近、辛いのにハマってるんだよね。\nスパイスがビッシビシ効いてるやつ！", "zh": "嗯！我最近爱上吃辣了。\n我喜欢香辛料很呛辣的那种！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1023_029umi", "source_sha256": "f9fb42208c318798f094d22ae1ed305a35f05d738f250d1355711d8bc2ce816c", "ja": "スパイス……！\nスパイスって、なんか女子力高そうでいいかもっ☆", "zh": "香辛料……！\n「香辛料」听起来女子力很高，好像不错耶☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1024_019min", "source_sha256": "509f4312b71dde0430ebfe28c1a5748d6db5749ba1e63aa8796208fddad9c528", "ja": "女子力高いのかな？　あ、でも健康にいいものって、\nなんとなく女子力っぽい感じがするかも……", "zh": "女子力有高吗？啊，但是有益健康的食物，\n确实会给人一点女子力的感觉呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1025_019min", "source_sha256": "70ae03b0bddf51a4fb3859d5880011e235546962cbbbc85f0eacc04a27555f53", "ja": "夏バテにも良さそうですし、屋台に\n辛いメニューを揃えるのはいいかもしれませんね♪", "zh": "而且好像有助于对抗夏日倦怠。\n在摊贩摆上香辣菜色，或许是个好主意喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1026_027say", "source_sha256": "9a1c83f7f8fbf3383156b75932e8fef45dbb70a9435faab21a7eeaef63acb35d", "ja": "それじゃあ屋台は、スパイスを利かせた\n辛めのメニューを中心に！ってことでいいかな？", "zh": "那摊贩的菜色，\n就决定以添加香辛料的辣味料理为中心啰？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1027_043nor", "source_sha256": "e8c7c37f6a4b4d350d399c8b5f4be7ccd6ab55e6ac6580eaec61bf761d378d2a", "ja": "オッケー！　せっかくだから、\n劇場のオリジナルメニューも出したいよね～。", "zh": "OK！既然都要摆摊了，\n就会想加入剧场原创的菜色诶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1028_037nao", "source_sha256": "deeaa8cb7168556a9706bb001e0abd79a326f3a77fc801f55cdd2728aa5fa91e", "ja": "せやな！　たこ焼きも、普通のソースと辛いソース、\n2種類から選べたらおもろいやんな。", "zh": "嘿呀！章鱼烧也是，可以分成普通酱料和香辣酱料，\n这样有两种口味可以选，应该满有意思的吼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1029_p", "source_sha256": "9edd43313550fa9e8e610e0372e167d73838e85d72725a0104d91bb48352dee4", "ja": "あとは、やきそばだな。\nスパイスでオリジナリティを出すとして……。", "zh": "还有就是炒面对吧。\n那就用香辛料来展现原创性……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1030_029umi", "source_sha256": "19c4d92e6190f97facb4683f85507b73dfb3844a5f6c7c4775273d33d2fee3c9", "ja": "……オホン！", "zh": "……咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1031_p", "source_sha256": "1031ca2a64044690cdf73c8f42eb8d9be99612ca1b3f6321838d7121c230f83b", "ja": "ん？　海美、どうした？", "zh": "嗯？海美，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1032_029umi", "source_sha256": "bd3d56840379ecc916e1c17620aa61d5173852101f9eb4e1a3b39c2a1f18640f", "ja": "私……女子力やきそば作るっ！", "zh": "我……要做女子力炒面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1033_037nao", "source_sha256": "2f23036e29579ba45c44cea153dcc1f305a64f6f94c63aec1111196d3420f1c1", "ja": "女子力やきそば……！？", "zh": "女子力炒面……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
