{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1036_043nor", "source_sha256": "2f23036e29579ba45c44cea153dcc1f305a64f6f94c63aec1111196d3420f1c1", "ja": "女子力やきそば……！？", "zh": "女子力炒面……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1037_037nao", "source_sha256": "d97143d513af7a630581453e5a073ca464633c4a904f06d0e84962f038ee4bb3", "ja": "海美……。\nその顔、何かビジョンがあるんやな？", "zh": "海美……\n看你的表情，是已经有明确的想法了吼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1038_029umi", "source_sha256": "6a1f9b46789960b3a257d47889bdf40ec7c7f7fa01dd0ae8b59ccfc4aeecc9f7", "ja": "ふっふっふ……さっきスパイスの話を聞いてから、\n考えてたんだーっ！　私にまかせてっ☆", "zh": "哼哼哼……刚才听你们在讲香辛料，我就想到了～！\n包在我身上吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1039_027say", "source_sha256": "148f1a45becd8d00c957080a705b11bcead44a2f0802122d11219af7a3b01213", "ja": "自信がありそうだね、海美。\nそれじゃ、やきそばはお願いしてもいい？", "zh": "看来你好像很有自信呢，海美。\n那炒面可以交给你负责吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1040_029umi", "source_sha256": "3e93753ba4d373f9aded8403501517efe64e16e6325e43a26bce4c61679cbd10", "ja": "もちろん！\nみんな、期待して待っててね☆", "zh": "当然没问题！\n大家好好期待吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1041_019min", "source_sha256": "1f2797764842e9f64aca87605432dd720b25dc6cfe864b80adf096c41fc92863", "ja": "海美ちゃん、何かあったら言ってね！\n私も手伝うから。", "zh": "海美，有什么需要就说喔！\n我也会帮忙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1042_029umi", "source_sha256": "46ae74f6672f810108a5e8db52167e93c85c420f2ffa360b907d38680bbf4d8c", "ja": "ありがと、みなちん！\nよーしっ、がんばるぞー☆", "zh": "谢啦，美美奈！\n好～我要加油啰～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1043_p", "source_sha256": "0c55f270c3de22478082193ffd50fe59cf58db77d031b3d44887c7946c99a430", "ja": "（少し心配な気もするが……\n海美の自主性を重んじて、信じよう！）", "zh": "（虽然我有点担心……\n但就尊重海美的自主性，相信她吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1044_p", "source_sha256": "0d59119ffc2718dbcf4d261d4f83872ff5b699290fe12e33c6153cba839ecf6b", "ja": "海美、期待してるからな。\nじゃあ話がまとまったところで……ん？", "zh": "海美，我很期待喔。\n那既然讨论出结果了……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1045_027say", "source_sha256": "c7085e4f5b37f08e5f6e9f3cdcd344fbf6586687a8f28d0c9b1b99ee6796c111", "ja": "海美、困ったことがあったら言ってね。私も、\n美奈子さんほど料理が得意なわけじゃないけど……。", "zh": "海美，有什么困难尽管说喔。\n虽然我不像美奈子那么会做菜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1046_043nor", "source_sha256": "7f502e45d79cc023c3108d06c299bf92925e83296ef2dca8a6a0606abccac468", "ja": "そうそう、困ったときはお互いさまだしさ！\nそういうアタシも、そんなに得意じゃないけど……。", "zh": "没错没错，有困难就要互相帮助啊！\n虽说我也不是很擅长……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1047_029umi", "source_sha256": "fa98754ef961688bd01e59ef3c0d1681e72d7d8965228d2015c15779cfede209", "ja": "さよちん、のりさん、ありがとー！\nそんなに心配しなくても大丈夫だってば☆", "zh": "纱纱、阿法姊，谢啦～！\n你们不用那么担心啦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1048_037nao", "source_sha256": "b2442de28a775baa887be7aa936a78356a7a340a70656c535e747d583193f3a5", "ja": "なあなあ、みんなまっすぐ帰るん？　屋台の話したら、\nお腹空いてきたわ。何か食べて帰らへん？", "zh": "欸欸，大家都要直接回家吗？\n聊完摊贩我都饿啦，要不要吃点东西再回去呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1049_019min", "source_sha256": "1cd1dd014256bdbb4e3df7336008bebd059470b66253fd50ee982dbd580e47ed", "ja": "メニューのことも、もうちょっと相談したいよね。\nみんな、私の家に寄ってく？", "zh": "我也想再多讨论一下菜色。\n大家要不要来我家坐坐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1050_p", "source_sha256": "36ea17d5aeab8ca0107652ca37974696bb4f9042fff7e57df194c24e8cae4611", "ja": "（みんな、話に夢中だな。なんだか、\n女子校の先生にでもなったような気分だが……）", "zh": "（大家聊得还真热烈。\n感觉自己好像女校老师……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0035_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_02_1051_p", "source_sha256": "ae7226ce96108bfe1021ac18daa01c5227aa019c286850678afc0ba28319d78d", "ja": "（みんなのやる気が、ものすごく伝わってくる。\nこっちも、気を抜いていられないな！）", "zh": "（能够感受到大家满满的干劲，\n我也不能松懈了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
